====================================================================================================
REPEATABILITY, WHICH IS WORSE THAN ANY OTHER ROW IN TUNED
====================================================================================================
  The IDENTICAL cell (lr=0.03, eps=0.05) scored 0.1707 in sweep 1 and 0.2421 in
  sweep 2. Initial parameters and the optimiser's own RNG are seeded; the
  estimator's shot noise is NOT. 2-trial noise is therefore about 0.07, which is
  the same size as the spacing between grid cells.

  NO CONCLUSION SHOULD BE DRAWN FROM ANY SINGLE CELL. What survives is the
  aggregate: QN-SPSA's optimum sits at 0.17-0.24 however it is read.

====================================================================================================
THE RESULT
====================================================================================================
                    score        nefv    H2      MaxCut N=4   Heisenberg N=4
  QN-SPSA (best)   0.17-0.24      263   0.0155     0.1765         0.3201
  QLTO V6          0.0254          60   0.0065     0.0043         0.0654

  V6 wins all three problems, by 7-10x on aggregate score, at 4.4x fewer
  circuits. The comparison is harsher than that: the suite plots against NEFV,
  so at MATCHED cost QN-SPSA would get about 4.5 epochs to V6's 20.

  THE INFORMATIVE PART IS WHERE QN-SPSA LOSES WORST. MaxCut N=4 is 0.1765
  against V6's 0.0043 - and MaxCut is precisely the family where full QNG beats
  V6, reaching 0.0047 at N=6 for 52x the circuits. So the metric advantage does
  NOT survive being SPSA-estimated: the geometry that helps needs the expensive
  exact QFIM.

  That is the same conclusion the earlier AdamW/QFIM ablation reached from the
  other direction, where F^-1 preconditioning applied ON TOP of V6 hurt because
  kappa(F) = 349 and the inverse amplifies noise along low-metric directions.
  Both halves now agree: adding the metric to V6 hurts, and obtaining the metric
  cheaply does not work either. The 2M saving and the preconditioning remain
  mutually exclusive.
